&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;On-device / mobile:&lt;/strong&gt; Gemma 4 E2B (only one with native audio at this size)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  What This Means for Founders
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you're building a business and using AI, pay attention.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. The cost of AI just dropped dramatically&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

