&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Local agents are viable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;With native function calling and thinking mode, you can build agents that automate complete workflows without depending on cloud services. Imagine an assistant that reads your emails, updates your CRM, generates reports, and schedules posts — all running on your laptop.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Edge computing with AI just exploded&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A 2.3B active parameter model that understands audio, images, and text, running on a Raspberry Pi. The possibilities for IoT, home automation, medical devices, and retail are enormous.&lt;/p&gt;

